window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A Highlander’s wounded heart calls to her...across time. For all fans of </b><b><i>Outlander</i></b><b>!</b></p> <p>Fleeing a man in a Scottish castle, American Kate Anderson tumbles into the dungeon. Striking her head, she suffers amnesia and is sent back in time to 1308, where she’s rescued by a Highland warrior.</p> <p>Escaped slave Ian Cambel takes Kate to his estate. But as her memories flood back, she’s driven to return to the 21st century. Helping Kate leave means fighting the invading English troops - and losing a piece of his heart. Will the peace-seeking former gladiator battle his demons and the enemy for a doomed love?</p> <p>Narrated by the award-winning narrator, Audie finalist, and Earphones for Excellence in Narration winner Shane East, along with Emma Wilder, a classically trained actor and narrator who has worked all over the world on everything from steamy romance novels to Shakespeare.</p>"; 
